<title>UK: EU rejects all bids at grain tender - officials.</title>
<headline>EU rejects all bids at grain tender - officials.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thursday's EU grains management committee rejected all bids for intervention and open market grains at its weekly export tender, member state officials said.</p>
<p>--Christopher Lyddon, London newsroom +44 171 542 7928</p>
</text>
